   "source": [
    "Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose we want to build an AI Assistant.\n",
    "\n",
    "Users may ask:\n",
    "\n",
    "Summarize this PDF.\n",
    "\n",
    "Analyze this CSV.\n",
    "\n",
    "Search latest AI news.\n",
    "\n",
    "Compare this document with internet sources.\n",
    "\n",
    "Generate a report.\n",
    "\n",
    "Create charts.\n",
    "\n",
    "Explain this research paper.\n",
    "\n",
    "Question:\n",
    "\n",
    "How does the AI know what to do?\n",
    "\n",
    "Should it\n",
    "\n",
    "Search?\n",
    "\n",
    "or\n",
    "\n",
    "Use RAG?\n",
    "\n",
    "or\n",
    "\n",
    "Execute Python?\n",
    "\n",
    "or\n",
    "\n",
    "Do everything?\n",
    "\n",
    "There must be someone who decides.\n",
    "\n",
    "That is called the Planner."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0546f0da-a37f-4ffa-8236-b2b96e8b706b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
